{"id":"afc8261d138c3006","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-prop-tree-level.md","title":"Levels of a κ-Tree","display":"prop-tree-level — Levels of a κ-Tree","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-tree-level","aliases":["58-prop-tree-level"],"display":"prop-tree-level — Levels of a κ-Tree","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-tree-prop.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-tree-level"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-tree-level</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-tree-level — Levels of a κ-Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fa77c5c28538fe4e\" href=\"?note=fa77c5c28538fe4e\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-tree-prop.md\">../batch16/58-df-tree-prop.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa\\in V\">\\(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lev}_\\alpha(T)=\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{ht}_T(t)=\\alpha\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Lev}_\\alpha(T)=\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{ht}_T(t)=\\alpha\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fa77c5c28538fe4e\" href=\"?note=fa77c5c28538fe4e\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-tree-prop.md\">../batch16/58-df-tree-prop.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fa77c5c28538fe4e\" href=\"?note=fa77c5c28538fe4e\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-tree-prop.md\">../batch16/58-df-tree-prop.md</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}tree\\text{-}level}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{ht}(T)=\\kappa\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(|\\operatorname{Lev}_\\alpha(T)|&lt;\\kappa)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}tree\\text{-}level}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{ht}(T)=\\kappa\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(|\\operatorname{Lev}_\\alpha(T)|&lt;\\kappa)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This proposition records the level-size and height clauses of the standard definition of a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-tree.</li>\n<li>A <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-Aronszajn tree additionally has no cofinal branch.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-tree-prop.md","status":"resolved","id":"fa77c5c28538fe4e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-tree-prop.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-tree-prop.md","status":"resolved","id":"fa77c5c28538fe4e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Lev}_\\alpha(T)=\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{ht}_T(t)=\\alpha\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-tree-prop.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-tree-prop.md","status":"resolved","id":"fa77c5c28538fe4e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-tree-prop.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,<_{T},\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Lev}_\\alpha(T)=\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{ht}_T(t)=\\alpha\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}tree\\text{-}level}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,<_{T},\\kappa)\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{ht}(T)=\\kappa\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(|\\operatorname{Lev}_\\alpha(T)|<\\kappa)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":919,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4004","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-prop-tree-level.md|58-prop-tree-level]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["fa77c5c28538fe4e"]}